  "metadata": {
    "name": "zerostate",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "spec": "0.1.0",
    "description": "0state DAO — communist, proof-of-mine governance over frankcoin"
  },
  "docs": [
    "0state — a political organization governed by the miners of frankcoin.",
    "",
    "franks are a currency: earned, held, and freely traded. The franchise is",
    "something else. Membership is acquired only by MINING and is non-transferable,",
    "so no accumulation of capital can acquire control of the organization. Money",
    "and the vote are held separately.",
    "",
    "Membership is permissionless — mining an accepted frankcoin proof lets a",
    "wallet `join`; there is no admitting authority. Voting weight reflects a",
    "member's mining, tempered sub-linearly and decaying with inactivity, so",
    "influence tracks recent labour, not wealth. Proposals are decided first past",
    "the post. This program is the VOTING layer only; it holds no funds."
  ],
